  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最後の目を伏せたポーズとか、\r\n夜の雰囲気と合っててよかったぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040010,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……別に\r\nただ眠くなってきただけですよー",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、じゃあそういうことにしておくか\r\n何か飲むか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040020,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "んー……メロンソーダ\r\n上にソフトクリームが乗ったやつでー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは山奥では難しい注文だな……\r\nオレンジジュースでいいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040030,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "んー",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040030"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0466",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "摩美々、恋鐘、霧子……\r\nここまでの撮影は順調だ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0467",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "明日からはアンティーカ全員の撮影になる\r\n咲耶と結華も夕方には到着するから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040040,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "はぁい\r\n……そういえば",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040050,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……………",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040060,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……やっぱりなんでもー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　なんだ気になるじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040070,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……んー……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040080,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "この間、咲耶とプロデューサーが\r\n廊下で話してるの、聞いちゃったんですよねー",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この間…………\r\n！　ああ、事務所の廊下の……あの時か",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040090,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……でもプロデューサーと話したんだから、\r\nもう解決済みかなって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040100,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "なので、別になんでもないですー",
    "charAnim1": "play",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……\r\nそうか…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040110,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……違うんで\r\nそういうつもりじゃないんでー",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040120,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "プライベートな話に\r\n踏み込んだりしませんからぁ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん……そうだな\r\n確かに、俺から言うことじゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もしなにか気になるようだったら、\r\n摩美々から話を聞いてやってくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040130,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……そういうのは\r\nプロデューサーの方がいいと思いますケドー",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ！　もちろん俺も聞くさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど、今の咲耶には、\r\n摩美々やみんなの力も必要なんだと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040140,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040150,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そんなに大変な感じなんですかぁ？",
