    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……どうだろう？\r\n本人は『なんでもない』と言っていたな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040160,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "じゃー、平気なんじゃないですかぁ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/500200204/5002002040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。だから平気なのかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 5002002040170,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "はぁ……よくわからないですケド……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
